  <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
    <name>ApplySettingsGroup</name>
    <id>2105</id>
    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>HowToApplySettings</name>
      <id>2107</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>After the settings are changed, &lt;link RefreshInterface>refresh all tabs&lt;/> or restart the application.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>پس از تغییر تنظیمات، &lt;link RefreshInterface>همه زبانه‌ها را بازخوانی کنید&lt;/> یا برنامه را مجدداً راه‌اندازی کنید.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>После изменения настроек необходимо &lt;link RefreshInterface>переоткрыть все открытые окна&lt;/> или перезайти в программу.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Ayarları değiştirdikten sonra &lt;link RefreshInterface>tüm açık pencereleri yeniden açın&lt;/> veya programa tekrar girin.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Sau khi thay đổi tùy chỉnh, cần &lt;link RefreshInterface>mở lại tất cả các cửa sổ đã mở&lt;/> hoặc đăng nhập lại vào chương trình.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>After the settings are changed, &lt;link RefreshInterface>refresh all tabs&lt;/> or restart the application.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>After the settings are changed, &lt;link RefreshInterface>refresh all tabs&lt;/> or restart the application.</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>HowToApplySettingsExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>2109</id>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
          <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
        </extInfo>
      </extendedTooltip>
      <contextMenu>
        <name>HowToApplySettingsContextMenu</name>
        <id>2108</id>
        <autoFill>true</autoFill>
      </contextMenu>
      <formatted>true</formatted>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <handlers>
          <event>URLProcessing</event>
          <name>HowToApplySettingsURLProcessing</name>
        </handlers>
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
